:: StoryTitle
Chaobuli Story VN

:: StoryData
{
  "ifid": "F2277A49-95C0-4706-A598-B5F256AB183F",
  "format": "SugarCube",
  "format-version": "2.36.1"
}

:: Start
<<setbg "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?w=800">>
<<setsprite "none">>

<<dialogue>>
<<name>>Narrator<</name>>
<<text>>
In the village of Bharatpur, there lived a poor man named Dukhu. He worked hard every day but barely had enough to feed his family.

[[Continue->Scene2]]
<</text>>
<</dialogue>>

:: Scene2
<<setbg "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?w=800">>
<<setsprite "https://i.pravatar.cc/300?img=33">>

<<dialogue>>
<<name>>Dukhu<</name>>
<<text>>
One day, I heard about a wealthy merchant who was known for his generosity. Perhaps he could help me and my family.

[[Visit the merchant->Scene3]]
[[Look for other options->Scene2Alt]]
<</text>>
<</dialogue>>

:: Scene2Alt
<<setbg "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?w=800">>
<<setsprite "https://i.pravatar.cc/300?img=33">>

<<dialogue>>
<<name>>Dukhu<</name>>
<<text>>
After thinking it over, I realized that the merchant's help might be my best chance. I should visit him.

[[Go to the merchant->Scene3]]
<</text>>
<</dialogue>>

:: Scene3
<<setbg "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560185893-a55cbc8c57e8?w=800">>
<<setsprite "https://i.pravatar.cc/300?img=12">>

<<dialogue>>
<<name>>Merchant<</name>>
<<text>>
Welcome, Dukhu! I've heard of your struggles. I can offer you work, but it will test your honesty and determination.

I need someone to deliver a precious package to the next village. Many have tried, but few have succeeded without succumbing to temptation.

[[Accept the task->Scene4]]
[[Ask for more details first->Scene3Alt]]
<</text>>
<</dialogue>>

:: Scene3Alt
<<setbg "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1560185893-a55cbc8c57e8?w=800">>
<<setsprite "https://i.pravatar.cc/300?img=12">>

<<dialogue>>
<<name>>Merchant<</name>>
<<text>>
Smart man! The task is simple: deliver this sealed package without opening it. Your reward will depend on your integrity.

[[Accept and begin the journey->Scene4]]
<</text>>
<</dialogue>>

:: Scene4
<<setbg "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506905925346-21bda4d32df4?w=800">>
<<setsprite "https://i.pravatar.cc/300?img=33">>

<<dialogue>>
<<name>>Dukhu<</name>>
<<text>>
I began my journey with the sealed package. The road was long, and curiosity gnawed at me. What could be so valuable inside?

The temptation grew stronger with each step...

[[Open the package->BadEnding]]
[[Resist and continue the journey->GoodEnding]]
<</text>>
<</dialogue>>

:: BadEnding
<<setbg "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1495954484750-af469f2f9be5?w=800">>
<<setsprite "https://i.pravatar.cc/300?img=33">>

<<dialogue>>
<<name>>Narrator<</name>>
<<text>>
Dukhu couldn't resist. He opened the package and found it contained only chaobuli—puffed rice. It was a test of his honesty.

The merchant refused to help him further, and Dukhu returned home with nothing, having lost his one chance at prosperity.

[[Start Over->Start]]
<</text>>
<</dialogue>>

:: GoodEnding
<<setbg "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1533090161767-e6ffed986c88?w=800">>
<<setsprite "https://i.pravatar.cc/300?img=12">>

<<dialogue>>
<<name>>Merchant<</name>>
<<text>>
Well done, Dukhu! You have proven your honesty. The package contained only chaobuli, but your integrity is worth more than gold.

I hereby offer you a permanent position in my business. You and your family will never go hungry again.

[[Play Again->Start]]
<</text>>
<</dialogue>>

